        "id": 55764,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T06:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In terms of balance, I think it is important to note that there are several villains that make the heroes damage themselves. Depending on your team, Legacy's Galvanize can end up hurting&nbsp;as much as it helps.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
