      {
        "id": 55767,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T13:59:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>SoundofTrees, I really&nbsp;don't think Legacy is a difficulty zero. As a support hero you make the best plays when you know the other heroes' decks hands and abilities.&nbsp;I wouldn't move him to a two, but playing Legacy is not always easy. I would argue that Ra is easier to grasp. Playing Ra can sometimes feel like asking yourself \"Should I do lots of&nbsp;damage or should I do a lot damage?\"</p>",
