      {
        "id": 55769,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T17:29:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Totally understand, lynkfox! My wording was poor, and I didn't realize it until I read your response.&nbsp;I am <em>not</em> saying I don't think there's value in the analysis. I know the &gt;G folks are very interested in seeing the results, and that's reason enough for me.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"> &nbsp;But I also understand the statistical possibilities and how it works. I also shouldn't have said \"primarily\", as that's not true - I'm <em>primarily </em>not getting involved because I just haven't been able to make time to document all the games and then get them into the data.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>\n<p>I'm very glad you guys are doing it!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 26,
